#: user_guide/supervisor_relaunch.rst:1
msgid "Supervisor hot replacement"
msgstr "Sustitución en caliente del Supervisor"

#: user_guide/supervisor_relaunch.rst:1
msgid ""
"On Linux and macOS, ``xinference-supervisor`` can replace its Supervisor control "
"process while retaining the API, Workers and model processes. The HTTP address and "
"Supervisor actor address stay the same. New inference requests continue using the "
"serving routes while the replacement prepares; existing streams stay on their model "
"processes."
msgstr ""
"En Linux y macOS, ``xinference-supervisor`` puede sustituir el proceso de control "
"Supervisor conservando los procesos de API, Worker y modelos. Las direcciones HTTP y "
"del actor Supervisor no cambian. Durante la preparación, las nuevas solicitudes de "
"inferencia siguen usando las rutas activas y los flujos existentes permanecen en sus "
"procesos de modelo."

#: user_guide/supervisor_relaunch.rst:1
msgid ""
"Use ``POST /v1/supervisor/relaunch``, ``xinference relaunch-supervisor`` or "
"``Client.relaunch_supervisor()``. Authentication requires an administrator session. "
"The optional ``python_executable`` must be an absolute path to an already prepared "
"compatible Xinference environment on the Supervisor machine. Omit it to reuse the "
"serving Supervisor's environment."
msgstr ""
"Use ``POST /v1/supervisor/relaunch``, ``xinference relaunch-supervisor`` o "
"``Client.relaunch_supervisor()``. Con la autenticación habilitada se requiere una "
"sesión de administrador. El parámetro opcional ``python_executable`` debe ser una "
"ruta Python absoluta a un entorno Xinference compatible ya preparado en la máquina "
"Supervisor. Si se omite, se reutiliza el entorno Supervisor actual."

#: user_guide/supervisor_relaunch.rst:1
msgid ""
"The replacement loads persisted configuration and checks the registered Workers' live"
" model inventories and ownership. Management operations briefly wait during state "
"transfer; model route lookups remain available. An active model launch, download, "
"model reload or Worker handoff prevents replacement until that operation finishes. "
"Failed preparation leaves the previous Supervisor serving."
msgstr ""
"El proceso de sustitución carga la configuración persistida y comprueba los modelos "
"activos y su propiedad en los Workers registrados. Las operaciones de gestión esperan"
" brevemente durante la transferencia de estado; las consultas de rutas de modelos "
"siguen disponibles. Un inicio, descarga o recarga de modelo, o un traspaso de Worker "
"en curso impide la sustitución hasta que finalice. Si falla la preparación, el "
"Supervisor anterior continúa atendiendo solicitudes."

#: user_guide/supervisor_relaunch.rst:1
msgid ""
"The HTTP 202 response includes an ``operation_id``. Poll ``GET /v1/supervisor-"
"relaunches/{operation_id}`` or list operations with ``GET /v1/supervisor-"
"relaunches``. States are ``starting``, ``preparing``, ``switching``, ``draining``, "
"``succeeded`` and ``failed``. Only one Supervisor replacement runs at a time. Reuse "
"``request_id`` when retrying the same operation; history lasts until the stable "
"service host stops."
msgstr ""
"La respuesta HTTP 202 incluye un ``operation_id``. Consulte ``GET /v1/supervisor-"
"relaunches/{operation_id}`` o liste las operaciones con ``GET /v1/supervisor-"
"relaunches``. Los estados son ``starting``, ``preparing``, ``switching``, "
"``draining``, ``succeeded`` y ``failed``. Solo se ejecuta una sustitución del "
"Supervisor a la vez. Reutilice ``request_id`` al reintentar la misma operación; el "
"historial permanece hasta que se detiene el host de servicio estable."

#: user_guide/supervisor_relaunch.rst:1
msgid ""
"The service must have been started with Supervisor hosting support. The stable host "
"and its state, cache, event, progress and model-routing actors retain their original "
"environments. This operation upgrades Supervisor control logic; upgrading retained "
"actors or changing database schemas requires a planned restart. Local mode and "
"Windows are unsupported."
msgstr ""
"El servicio debe haberse iniciado con soporte de alojamiento del Supervisor. El host "
"estable y sus actores de estado, caché, eventos, progreso y rutas de modelos "
"conservan sus entornos originales. Esta operación actualiza la lógica de control "
"Supervisor; actualizar los actores conservados o cambiar esquemas de base de datos "
"requiere un reinicio planificado. El modo local y Windows no son compatibles."
